                "content": [
                  {
                    "nodeType": "text",
                    "value": "All month long, mo’s, ’staches and soup strainers have been sprouting in the Davis Elen office. The reason? Movember! This month-long abstinence from shaving is a fun way to support men’s health. Donations to the Movember Foundation target prostate cancer, testicular cancer, suicide and mental health issues. At Team Davis Elen’s final check-in on November 27, awards were handed out for the finest Mos. Categories included Most Creative, Best Grown, and Freestyle. Remember, if you didn’t grow a mo’ this month, you can still join the team. Contributions are always welcome at ",
